https://github.com/julmaxi/summary_bias at the revision recorded in that script.
It is not included in the source distribution. Dataset and external model
licenses are separate from the license on this project's original code.

Datasets keep their original licences, which are listed in data/README.md.
Files included under data/processed/ are redistributed under those terms:
BBQ (CC BY 4.0), BOLD (CC BY-SA 4.0), FairLex/ECtHR (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0,
